 * <div id="mysql-xdevapi-collectionfind.fields" class="refentry"> <div class="refnamediv">  <h1 class="refname">CollectionFind::fields</h1>  <p class="verinfo">(No version information available, might only be in Git)</p><p class="refpurpose"><span class="refname">CollectionFind::fields</span> — <span class="dc-title">Set document field filter</span></p> </div> <div class="refsect1 description" id="refsect1-mysql-xdevapi-collectionfind.fields-description">  <h3 class="title">说明</h3>  <div class="methodsynopsis dc-description">   <span class="modifier">public</span> <span class="modifier">function</span> <span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832"><strong>mysql_xdevapi\CollectionFind::fields</strong></span>(<span class="methodparam"><span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.string.php" class="type string" style="color:#EAB766">string</a></span> <span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">\$projection</span></span>): <span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/class.mysql-xdevapi-collectionfind.php" class="type mysql_xdevapi\CollectionFind" style="color:#EAB766">mysql_xdevapi\CollectionFind</a></span></div>  <p class="para rdfs-comment">   Defines the columns for the query to return. If not defined,   all columns are used.  </p> </div> <div class="refsect1 parameters" id="refsect1-mysql-xdevapi-collectionfind.fields-parameters">  <h3 class="title">参数</h3>  <dl>       <dt><span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">projection</span></dt>    <dd>     <p class="para">      Can either be a single string or an array of strings identifying the      columns to be returned for each document that match the search condition.     </p>    </dd>     </dl> </div> <div class="refsect1 returnvalues" id="refsect1-mysql-xdevapi-collectionfind.fields-returnvalues">  <h3 class="title">返回值</h3>  <p class="para">   A CollectionFind object that can be used for further processing.  </p> </div> <div class=