>mysql_xdevapi\TableSelect::bind()</strong></span> example</strong></p>   <div class="example-contents"><div class="phpcode" style="border-color:gray;background:#1E1F22;"><blockquote style="border:1px gray solid;white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color: #000000"><span style="color: #9876AA">&lt;?php<br>\$session </span><span style="color: #007700">= </span><span style="color: #9876AA">mysql_xdevapi\getSession</span><span style="color: #007700">(</span><span style="color: #DD0000">"mysqlx://user:password@localhost"</span><span style="color: #007700">);<br><br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$schema </span><span style="color: #007700">= </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$session</span><span style="color: #007700">-&gt;</span><span style="color: #9876AA">getSchema</span><span style="color: #007700">(</span><span style="color: #DD0000">"addressbook"</span><span style="color: #007700">);<br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$table  </span><span style="color: #007700">= </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$schema</span><span style="color: #007700">-&gt;</span><span style="color: #9876AA">getTable</span><span style="color: #007700">(</span><span style="color: #DD0000">"names"</span><span style="color: #007700">);<br><br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$result </span><span style="color: #007700">= </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$table</span><span style="color: #007700">-&gt;</span><span style="color: #9876AA">select</span><span style="color: #007700">(</span><span style="color: #DD0000">'name'</span><span style="color: #007700">,</span><span style="color: #DD0000">'age'</span><span style="color: #007700">)<br>  -&gt;</span><span style="color: #9876AA">where</span><span style="color: #007700">(</span><span style="color: #DD0000">'name like :name and age &gt; :age'</span><span style="color: #007700">)<br>  -&gt;</span><span style="color: #9876AA">bind</span><span style="color: #007700">([</span><span style="color: #DD0000">'name' </span><span style="col